# Insurance Sales Intelligence Platform — Databricks Portfolio Project

A synthetic end-to-end insurance sales data engineering project for practising Databricks, PySpark, Spark SQL, Delta Lake, dimensional modelling, Medallion Architecture and conversational analytics.

## What is included

- 3 years of synthetic data: **2024–2026**
- ~158k policy-level sales transactions
- ~95k sales-funnel activity rows
- 30k synthetic customers
- Calendar + July–June fiscal date dimension
- Product, region/branch, sales team, salesperson, channel and customer dimensions
- Product × region × month targets
- SCD Type 2 salesperson assignment history
- Policy cancellation/lapse events
- Controlled data-quality defects for Silver-layer exercises
- Bronze ingestion with Databricks Auto Loader
- Silver cleansing/conformance in PySpark
- Gold weekly/monthly marts and target attainment
- SQL semantic view and example business questions
- Starter Streamlit conversational interface

## Architecture

```text
GitHub CSV source files
        |
        v
Bronze Delta (raw + metadata)
        |
        v
Silver Delta (cleaned + conformed + DQ flags)
        |
        v
Gold marts / semantic view
        |
        +--> Databricks SQL / BI dashboards
        |
        +--> Streamlit Sales Copilot
```

